            "| Cached slots | Treat cached results as a performance aid |\n"
            "| Rate limits | Keep caller identity and expiry visible when debugging |\n"
            "\n"
            "### Walkthrough\n"
            "\n"
            "1. Warm an availability query and compare the next response.\n"
            "2. Change an availability rule and check that stale slots disappear.\n"
            "   - Capture the relevant request or job identifier.\n"
            "   - Compare the user-visible outcome with the persisted or provider state.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Failure handling\n"
            "\n"
            "**Watch for:** A cache miss should not silently become an available appointment.\n"
