            "\n"
            "1. Exercise an authorized scheduling request with a test account.\n"
            "2. Repeat with expired credentials and a conflicting time slot.\n"
            "   - Capture the relevant request or job identifier.\n"
            "   - Compare the user-visible outcome with the persisted or provider state.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Failure handling\n"
            "\n"
            "**Watch for:** Retries must not create duplicate bookings after an ambiguous response.\n"
            "\n"
            "Suggested diagnostic signals: *request latency, authorization failures, and rate-limit responses*. Compare them over the same time window.\n"
